WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.925
Welcome to the TSJ (Tribe Street Journal) orientation

00:00:03.925 --> 00:00:04.062
.

00:00:04.062 --> 00:00:07.925
Carry finalized action narratives and approved PLI into Tribe Street

00:00:07.925 --> 00:00:10.738
Journal through explicit, auditable handoffs.

00:00:10.738 --> 00:00:14.062
Treat every queue item as a bounded specialist review.

00:00:14.062 --> 00:00:17.200
Confirm the source record and dependency state, inspect the

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:21.150
complete worksheet or handoff, use the explicit specialist control

00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:23.688
, and verify the resulting queue state.

00:00:23.688 --> 00:00:26.250
Your decision becomes evidence for White Cell;

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:29.175
it does not replace White Cell’s operational role.
